<title>USA: Kiddie Academy names CEO.</title>
<headline>Kiddie Academy names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BEL AIR, Md. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kiddie Academy International Inc said Friday it had named Angelo Bizzarro chief executive of the child-care centers firm.</p>
<p>Bizzarro, a director of the company, succeeds George Miller, who has been chief executive since 1995 and will remain as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Most recently, Bizzarro was president and chief executive of Caterair International Inc.</p>
